# Node
node_modules/
dist/

# Go build output. `go build` in docker/downloader drops the binary beside the
# source; the image builds it from scratch, so a committed copy is 9 MB of
# nothing and would be wrong for every architecture but the one that made it.
/docker/downloader/downloader
